Dear Gentlemen,



Please be informed that the main Jubail warehouse is ready to receive mater=
ials that can be stored in the open area.

The logistics officer, Mr. @Mohammed Mabrouk<mailto:mohammed.mabrouk@nesmai=
nfrastructure.com> and the storekeeper, Mr. @Quirino L. Sivilla Jr<mailto:q=
.sivilla@nesmainfrastructure.com> , will be responsible for managing the wa=
rehouse.



Therefore, please contact him and coordinate in advance before sending or i=
ssuing any materials, and provide him with all the necessary documents and =
information to ensure the receiving process is completed and arranged corre=
ctly.



Additionally, Mr. @Mohammed Mabrouk<mailto:mohammed.mabrouk@nesmainfrastruc=
ture.com> will be responsible for coordinating with your storekeepers and o=
rganizing all matters related to the tasks assigned to him.



Best Regards,

Amr Elkholy


